{"3624860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kuafu Chases the Sun", "steam_appid": 3624860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kuafu Chases the Sun</i>&quot; is a 2D side-scrolling parkour game inspired by Chinese mythology, where players embody the legendary giant Kuafu in a visually striking hand-painted world. Race across ancient landscapes—misty mountains, blooming valleys—while executing parkour moves like jumping and sliding to overcome obstacles, and unravel Kuafu's fate in the endings. The game blends mythic storytelling with cultural artistry, featuring unlockable lore from Shanhai Jing (Classic of Mountains and Seas).</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kuafu Chases the Sun</i>&quot; is a 2D side-scrolling parkour game inspired by Chinese mythology, where players embody the legendary giant Kuafu in a visually striking hand-painted world. Race across ancient landscapes—misty mountains, blooming valleys—while executing parkour moves like jumping and sliding to overcome obstacles, and unravel Kuafu's fate in the endings. The game blends mythic storytelling with cultural artistry, featuring unlockable lore from Shanhai Jing (Classic of Mountains and Seas).</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Kuafu Chases the sun&quot; is an exhilarating adventure parkour game deeply rooted in the rich tapestry of ancient Chinese mythology. In this immersive gaming experience, players are instantly transported to a bygone era, assuming the role of the mighty and legendary giant, Kuafu.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624860/1b46dc51a971eb8b0e876ada96b7dd46fa7d0df2/header.jpg?t=1748069043", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624860/60ca74991e9269b4487d6a20b43a80846fdd8835/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748069043", "capsule_imagev5": "https: